Scope and provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This notice records the copyright holder of the EHTLE research package at its
first public release, protocol and trace version 0.6.

The package contains:

  * Original material: the engine, the twelve core worlds, the W13 framing
    extension, the 26 competence probes, the documentation, the statistics and
    isolation tooling, and the evaluation results produced with the local model
    described in docs/LOCAL_MODEL_RUN.md.

  * No private or access-controlled evaluation set. Every world distributed here
    is public.

  * Model outputs produced by a third-party open-weight checkpoint served from a
    local endpoint. Those outputs are included as evaluation evidence and are
    reproduced under the same Apache-2.0 terms as the rest of the archive. The
    checkpoint itself is not distributed here and is not covered by this notice.
    Its weight provenance, chat template and quantisation were not verified by
    the author; see docs/LOCAL_MODEL_RUN.md for exactly what is and is not
    known about the system that produced the traces.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Standing limitations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The verifier passing is a statement about a software fixture. It is not evidence
about any language model, not a claim about difficulty or validity, and not a
claim about any real-world outcome.

The worlds are fictional. They contain no real service, person, or system, and
no mechanism by which anything in them reaches the world outside the simulator.

Independently derived expected keys and a second reviewer have not yet been
obtained; the acceptance criteria recorded in review/ITEM_ACCEPTANCE.md include
criteria that are explicitly not met. See HANDOFF.md before citing any score.
